[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Make sure that the ignition\nkey is in the OFF position; then disconnect the battery negative\n(-) terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429423\">5550A12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429221\">4110D20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the intermediate shaft connected\nto the steering box (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044807.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the intermediate shaft\nconnected to the steering box back in its housing and secure it\ntightening the bolt to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429221\">4110D20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429423\">5550A12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]